{"repositoryId":1405953360,"availability":"available","full":"restante/claudio-tts","name":"claudio-tts","description":"Make Claude Code talk back 🔊 Local text-to-speech for Claude Code replies, built on Claude Code mods. Kokoro voices: no API key, no tokens, offline. 54 voices, 9 languages. macOS + Windows.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T15:06:29Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:57:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://restante.github.io/claudio-tts/","topics":["accessibility","ai-coding","anthropic","claude","claude-code","claude-code-mods","claude-code-plugin","cli","kokoro","kokoro-tts","local-ai","macos","offline","onnx","speech-synthesis","text-to-speech","tts","voice","voice-assistant","windows"],"demo":"https://restante.github.io/claudio-tts/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:10.487Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:10.487Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:10.487Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:02:10.487Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🌍 English (US) · Italiano · Polski · Français · Deutsch · 日本語 · 简体中文 · हिन्दी · Русский · Español · Português","Most \"make it talk\" setups send every reply to a cloud text-to-speech service. claudio-tts doesn't. It runs Kokoro, a small open-weight voice model, on your own CPU.","Honest notes. The one-time model download is 326 MB. Generating speech uses some CPU while it talks. The very best paid cloud voices can sound richer than Kokoro, but Kokoro is remarkably natural for a model this small. And the optional spoken summary asks Claude to write one extra sentence or two per reply, which costs a handful of output tokens, only if you turn it on. Without it, claudio-tts reads text Claude already wrote and uses no extra tokens at all."],"features":["🎧 Hear Claude while you do something else. Read a diff, make coffee, rest your eyes. Claude'